@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="home-page">
    <h1 class="title-centre">Discovering the Countries of the World</h1>
    <h3 class="subTitle-centre">Daemon Cullen X00182575</h3>

    <div class="container-row">
        <div class="side left-flags">
            <img class="home-flag" src="images\Flag_of_Canada-1024x512.png">
            <img class="home-flag" src="images\Flag_of_United_Kingdom-1024x512.png">
        </div>
        <div class="intro">
            <p>This application has been created to explore the countries of the world from the REST Countries public API. You can look at all the countries of the world, their flags and more information. You will also find a pletera of fun and intresting statistics about the world.</p>
            <p>On the countries page you can scroll through all the countries of the world and information on them such as their population and region. You are able to sort the list in whatever way you want and view every country's flag along side them. Each country can be clicked and you will be sent to the Google map of the selected country to view it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="side right-flags">
            <img class="home-flag" src="images\Flag_of_Ireland-1024x512.png">
            <img class="home-flag" src="images\Flag_of_Palestine-1024x512.png">
        </div>
    </div>
</div>